  "claim_boundary": "This proof starts from the fixed empty gameplay-frame-1 Player/bullet state and executes 206 linked Reimu-A rank-1 transitions using only replay input masks. It derives Player motion and shooting cadence, all type-0 bullet movement with profile-bound PC24 arithmetic, 14-by-14 bounds reclamation, fixed nonterminating script-1088 ANM/timer effects, lowest-free-slot allocation, and a public digest over every intermediate state. The retail/reference oracle covers 50 fields and complete nested before/after/frame projections, with collided draw-only sprite z explicitly excluded because the next update overwrites it before semantic use. The proof fails closed after frame 207 because EnemyManager first changes a fired bullet to collided at frame 208. It is not a proof of Enemy/ECL collision, homing, ANM data correspondence, compiler correspondence, alias-complete writer noninterference, other shot types or ranks, bombs, item interaction, death/respawn, or a complete Player or gameplay kernel."
